#~| "The Tool Type (TT) can be:<BR>- <B>Circular</B> with 1 ... 4 teeth -> it "
#~| "is informative only. Being circular, <BR>the cut width in material is "
#~| "exactly the tool diameter.<BR>- <B>Ball</B> -> informative only and make "
